	(text "Front panel: OLED module, encoder, 3 buttons, 2 status LEDs"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.0 22.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 4.5 4.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 40 90 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "755099d0-5212-55f8-bf77-994b073d925e")
	)
	(text "The readout is an off-the-shelf I2C OLED module on a 4-wire lead. Everything on this sheet is on DGND (USB side)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.0 26.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(italic yes)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d7bc9804-b755-5bf6-86e2-56b8aca53dab")
	)
	(text "The module shows V, A, W, the set value, mode and status; menus for limits, fan and calibration.\nShort lead (under 15 cm) to the bezel. 1.3\" SH1106 modules are the readable choice at arm's length;\nthe 0.96\" SSD1306 is the same pinout and protocol family. R14 / R15 pull up the bus here because\nthe module may or may not carry its own."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.25 96.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "33d2934f-dc6d-5a0e-8008-3d7559e0b3a6")
	)
	(text "A   OLED module header: 1.3\" SH1106 or 0.96\" SSD1306, I2C address 0x3C, 3.3 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 115.03 49.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 50 120 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b3ab44dc-451c-5cf4-8736-7983c8a9aeb0")
	)
	(text "ON/OFF toggles the sink. MODE cycles CC/CV/CR/CP/BATT. MENU: limits, fan, cal. Push = digit select."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.25 174.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "937b1036-2ff9-554b-887e-fcb264882b91")
	)
	(text "B   Encoder and buttons (MCU pull-ups on the buttons, RC on the encoder)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 108.68 122.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 50 120 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e3e2f3e2-52bc-5a15-8448-a69699cb22e3")
	)
	(text "Panel LEDs beside the display: ON = the load is sinking, FAULT = a hardware trip or the firmware latch.\nThe heartbeat LED is on the MCU sheet. The mode (CC/CV/CR/CP/BATT) and REMOTE are shown on the OLED."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.25 234.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "37d27c5e-086c-5e17-a287-057575df5cb4")
	)
	(text "C   Status LEDs: ON (green) while the load sinks, FAULT (red) for OTP / OVP / NTC-open / OFF"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 115.03 190.29 0)
		(effects
